  "description": "DINVAA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C37 H82 Eu4 N2 Ni5 O44,3(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni5 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.067-3.944 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.92-111.65°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H100N2O48Ni5Eu4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 12 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
